{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/","title":"정천 EX-B1","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 정천의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"정천 EX-B1\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-B1\n위치\n일곱째목뼈가시돌기 아래에서 가쪽으로 0.5寸.\n취혈\n大椎(GV14) 가쪽 0.5寸에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.5～1寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-b1/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations."}
